Weapon override: let a player's hands swing a shapeshift form's weapons instead of their own.

Made against AzerothCore rev b3717c137710. Adds Player::SetWeaponOverride / ClearWeaponOverride /
GetWeaponOverride (three weapon templates held on the Player, memory only) and the
COA_WEAPON_OVERRIDE macro. While set: HasWeaponForAttack follows the form's weapons (a dual-wield
form swings both hands, a two-hander form never an off hand), weapon skill is full for the level,
normalized speed uses the form weapon, off-hand damage refreshes without Dual Wield, and swings
train no weapon skill. Equipped items keep enchants, procs, durability and item-dependent auras.
Optional for mod-shapeshift.

Apply from the core source root: git apply --check, then git apply.

